        "TileImage": "$($repository 8b4299ee-b72d-444c-b990-2eb909aff59f).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47,\r\rOur client has asked us to eliminate photographer Olvan Shillingford and camera man Jay Smart, believing that these two men hold rare footage of a man dressed as santa claus.\r\rYes, you read that correctly.\r\rThis man dressed as Santa is in fact a manic serial killer on the run from the organisation our client is working for. This is why our client would not only like you to eliminate the targets but to also aquire one of their cameras for evidence.\r\rHappy Hunting.",
